Folder: governance/thedoorway
Proposed breadcrumb: Contains the core engine of the Doorway Protocol, responsible for dynamic workspace contextualization and qualitative auditing. It features a self-healing DoorwayContextualizer that ensures substrate integrity by reconstructing missing governance files from redundant templates. The BestPracticesAuditor enforces coding standards (PEP8, SoC, SOLID) and performs contamination checks for legacy workspace references.
