Folder: roles
Proposed breadcrumb: Repository of specialized AI agent role definitions that govern the autonomous behavior of the substrate. Includes primary agents for orchestration (00), intake (01), genesis (02), and verification (12), each with distinct protocols and constraints. These markdown-based roles serve as the authoritative grounding for agent identification and cross-agent collaboration.
